      "current_tex": "\\begin{proposition}[Uniqueness of the Minimum]\n\\label{prop:uniqueness-of-the-minimum}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$. If $n_1,n_2\\in\\mathbb{R}$ are both minima of\n$A$, then\n\\[\n  n_1=n_2.\n\\]\n\n\\hyperref[prf:uniqueness-of-the-minimum]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{proposition}",
